   ```bash
   pip install -r requirements.txt
   ```

## Execucao
### Carregar e visualizar os dados
   ```bash
   python src/main.py
   ```
### notebooks
   ```bash
   python src/eda_natalia.py
   ```
## Tests
   ```bash
   python -m pytest -q
   ```

